The '''Melancholic Viking''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Viking Longhouse}} by the {{Zone|Spruce Woods}}. He gives the player access to a special shop if they complete a short quest to remind him of the sea.

== Quest ==
These steps must be completed without leaving [[The Park]]. After two minutes, the quest will reset and the player will have to complete the quest again if they wish to access the shop again.
# Use a {{Item|Magical Water Bucket}} to extinguish the fire in the cabin. The water must be placed directly onto the fire.
# Right-click either {{Item|Furnace}} to the left of the '''Melancholic Viking''' with a {{Item|Raw Cod}}. This will consume the fish, and make the furnace become active.
# Use the {{Item|Fish Hat}} {{AN|Splash}} {{Ability}}. It must be used a total of {{Green|15}} times, which costs {{Stat|Mana|150}}, for the '''Viking''' to finish reminiscing.

