== Trivia ==
*Interacting with the [[Furnace]] with a [[Trophy Fishes|Trophy Fish]] for the first time grants the {{ach|Meal fit for a King|ach=true}}.
*The "Throw them at people you hate!" line when interacting with a boat is a reference to people used to be able to throw boats at others to fill their inventory to troll or sabotage them at the [[Dark Auction]].
*The '''Viking'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s "I last saw the sea # years, # months ago." line is based on the time since October 30th<!-- Canada Timezone -->, 2009, or epoch time {{Code|1256960211193}}. This is 3,650 <!-- keep this at 3,650 --> days before October 28th, 2019.
*Once all steps have been completed, lightning will rain down from the sky, and the '''Viking''' will become the '''Joyful Viking'''. The shop will be available for {{Green|2}} minutes.

